{"id":"de46efac56b1e2dc","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-quotient-gluing.md","title":"Tagged Gluing Quotient","display":"df-quotient-gluing — Tagged Gluing Quotient","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-quotient-gluing","aliases":["58-df-quotient-gluing"],"display":"df-quotient-gluing — Tagged Gluing Quotient","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md]]","[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-quotient-gluing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-quotient-gluing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-quotient-gluing — Tagged Gluing Quotient"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"fdeb0db348e01893\" href=\"?note=fdeb0db348e01893\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,A,f,Q,\\tau_Q,D,R\\in V\">\\(X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,A,f,Q,\\tau_Q,D,R\\in V\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq Y\">\\(A\\subseteq Y\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{id}_X=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{id}_X=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f^{-1}[U]=\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}f:f(x)\\in U\\}\">\\(f^{-1}[U]=\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}f:f(x)\\in U\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivalenceClosure}_S(D,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivalenceClosure}_S(D,R)\\)</span> 仅在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\\subseteq D\\times D\">\\(R\\subseteq D\\times D\\)</span> 时使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TaggedUnionTopology}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{TaggedUnionTopology}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GluingRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GluingRelation}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GluingCarrier}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GluingCarrier}_S\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GluingProjection}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{GluingProjection}_S\\)</span> 分别由下式定义；带拓扑的函数只在两个输入均为拓扑空间时使用。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivRel}\">\\(\\mathrm{EquivRel}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"908bc7b079f5d25b\" href=\"?note=908bc7b079f5d25b\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md\">../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"fdeb0db348e01893\" href=\"?note=fdeb0db348e01893\" title=\"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md\">../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>外部接口 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Continuous}\">\\(\\mathrm{Continuous}\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"3cd1834de4f2efb2\" href=\"?note=3cd1834de4f2efb2\" title=\"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md\">../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md</a> 的同名定义与参数次序。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GluingQuotient}\">\\(\\mathrm{GluingQuotient}\\)</span> 为本原子在下式引入、量化绑定或仅作层级/排版标签的记号；其参数次序与适用域由相应公式固定，不作为额外的未声明外部对象。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y)\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times X)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times Y).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y)\\coloneqq(\\{0\\}\\times X)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times Y).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TaggedUnionTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\{0\\}\\times U)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times W):U\\in\\tau_X\\land W\\in\\tau_Y\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{TaggedUnionTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\coloneqq\n\\{(\\{0\\}\\times U)\\cup(\\{1\\}\\times W):U\\in\\tau_X\\land W\\in\\tau_Y\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{EquivalenceClosure}_S(D,R)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{E\\subseteq D\\times D:\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,D)\\land R\\subseteq E\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{EquivalenceClosure}_S(D,R)\\coloneqq\n\\bigcap\\{E\\subseteq D\\times D:\\mathrm{EquivRel}_S(E,D)\\land R\\subseteq E\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA\\subseteq Y\\land f\\in X^A\\to\n\\mathrm{GluingRelation}_S(X,Y,A,f)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{EquivalenceClosure}_S\\left(\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y),\n\\{\\langle\\langle1,a\\rangle,\\langle0,f(a)\\rangle\\rangle:a\\in A\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA\\subseteq Y\\land f\\in X^A\\to\n\\mathrm{GluingRelation}_S(X,Y,A,f)\\coloneqq\n\\mathrm{EquivalenceClosure}_S\\left(\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y),\n\\{\\langle\\langle1,a\\rangle,\\langle0,f(a)\\rangle\\rangle:a\\in A\\}\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA\\subseteq Y\\land f\\in X^A\\to\n\\mathrm{GluingCarrier}_S(X,Y,A,f)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\{z\\in\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y):\\langle z,d\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{GluingRelation}_S(X,Y,A,f)\\}:\nd\\in\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA\\subseteq Y\\land f\\in X^A\\to\n\\mathrm{GluingCarrier}_S(X,Y,A,f)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\{z\\in\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y):\\langle z,d\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{GluingRelation}_S(X,Y,A,f)\\}:\nd\\in\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\nA\\subseteq Y\\land f\\in X^A\\to\n\\mathrm{GluingProjection}_S(X,Y,A,f)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle d,\\{z\\in\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y):\\langle z,d\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{GluingRelation}_S(X,Y,A,f)\\}\\right\\rangle:\nd\\in\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\nA\\subseteq Y\\land f\\in X^A\\to\n\\mathrm{GluingProjection}_S(X,Y,A,f)\\coloneqq\n\\left\\{\\left\\langle d,\\{z\\in\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y):\\langle z,d\\rangle\\in\\mathrm{GluingRelation}_S(X,Y,A,f)\\}\\right\\rangle:\nd\\in\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y)\\right\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GluingQuotient}_S(Q,\\tau_Q,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,A,f)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land A\\subseteq Y\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,A,\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_Y\\},X,\\tau_X)\n\\land Q=\\mathrm{GluingCarrier}_S(X,Y,A,f)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S\n\\left(\\tau_Q,\\mathrm{GluingProjection}_S(X,Y,A,f),\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y),\n\\mathrm{TaggedUnionTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{GluingQuotient}_S(Q,\\tau_Q,X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y,A,f)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau_X)\\land\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(Y,\\tau_Y)\n\\land A\\subseteq Y\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{Continuous}_S(f,A,\\{U\\cap A:U\\in\\tau_Y\\},X,\\tau_X)\n\\land Q=\\mathrm{GluingCarrier}_S(X,Y,A,f)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S\n\\left(\\tau_Q,\\mathrm{GluingProjection}_S(X,Y,A,f),\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y),\n\\mathrm{TaggedUnionTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>两个输入载体先加上互不相同的标签，因此即使原集合有交集，也不会产生未指定的额外识别。</li>\n<li>等价闭包由所有包含生成关系的等价关系取交得到；该族包含全关系 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\times D\">\\(D\\times D\\)</span>。商载体及拓扑均被定义，不另行选择与粘合无关的拓扑。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"fdeb0db348e01893","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"908bc7b079f5d25b","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{EquivRel}$ 取 [[../batch02/58-df-equivalence-relation.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md","status":"resolved","id":"fdeb0db348e01893","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}$ 取 [[../batch10/58-df-zfc-top2-quotient-topology.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false},{"target":"../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md","status":"resolved","id":"3cd1834de4f2efb2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"外部接口 $\\mathrm{Continuous}$ 取 [[../batch19/58-df-continuous-map.md]] 的同名定义与参数次序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,Y,\\tau_X,\\tau_Y,A,f,Q,\\tau_Q,D,R\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq Y","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{id}_X=\\{\\langle x,x\\rangle:x\\in X\\}","display":false},{"tex":"f^{-1}[U]=\\{x\\in\\operatorname{dom}f:f(x)\\in U\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{EquivalenceClosure}_S(D,R)","display":false},{"tex":"R\\subseteq D\\times D","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TaggedUnionTopology}_S","display"