\\in\\tau_Y\\},X,\\tau_X)\n\\land Q=\\mathrm{GluingCarrier}_S(X,Y,A,f)\\\\\n&\\land\\mathrm{ZfcTop2QuotientTopology}_S\n\\left(\\tau_Q,\\mathrm{GluingProjection}_S(X,Y,A,f),\\mathrm{TaggedUnion}_S(X,Y),\n\\mathrm{TaggedUnionTopology}_S(X,\\tau_X,Y,\\tau_Y)\\right).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"D\\times D","display":false}],"bytes":3467,"backlinks":[{"id":"0c88d7bf21633cb8","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GluingQuotient}_S$ 使用 [[58-df-quotient-gluing.md]] 的加标签商集和商拓扑；$M$ 仍是商集本身，而非同胚类或带结构元组。"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1026","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-quotient-gluing.md|58-df-quotient-gluing]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["908bc7b079f5d25b","fdeb0db348e01893","3cd1834de4f2efb2"]}